      {
        "index": 1,
        "text": "Whether they are male or female, adolescents feel like deciding on everything themselves in spite of parents’ instruction, especially when they face problems like sex, mental stress, etc., which make them feel ashamed and embarrassed. Thus they often automatically get into trouble due to their imperfect comprehension and judgement. Some are addicted to cigarettes, only several packets of which will hurt their lungs and make them breathless quickly.",
        "zh": "无论男生还是女生，青少年都想自己决定一切，不顾父母的教导，尤其当他们面对性方面的问题，精神压力等等，这些问题会让他们羞愧、尴尬。所以，他们往往不自觉地陷入麻烦，因为理解力和判断力还不成熟。有些人沉迷于吸烟，几包烟就会伤害他们的肺，使他们很快变得气喘吁吁。",
        "start": 4.293333333333333,
